008000* --- 0000-MAIN: ENTRY
008100 0000-MAIN.
008200     INITIALIZE CLR-ERROR-BLOCK
008300     MOVE 'CLRCM110' TO ERR-PGM
008400     MOVE LS-MQ-AREA TO CLR-MQ-AREA
008500     PERFORM 2300-READ-CODE-LOOKUP THRU 2300-READ-CODE-LOOKUP-EXIT
008600     PERFORM 2500-EDIT-CODE-LOOKUP THRU 2500-EDIT-CODE-LOOKUP-EXIT
008700     PERFORM 2510-EDIT-CODE-LOOKUP-2 THRU
008800         2510-EDIT-CODE-LOOKUP-2-EXIT
